# Agreement Duration Calculation

This scope computes the total duration for which the textile trade agreement is applicable.

```catala
declaration scope AgreementDuration:
  input start_date content date
  input end_date content date
  output agreement_duration content duration
```

## Agreement Duration

The agreement applies from the start date to the end date, defining the total duration.

```catala
scope AgreementDuration:
  date round down
  definition agreement_duration equals end_date - start_date
```